/* Experiment 188 -- SIAM 100-Digit Challenge, App. D Problem 13 (Maxima column).
   Both rows SKIP.  Maxima's only numeric ODE integrator is rk (fixed-step
   RK4, floats only, no event location).  Without an event the statement is
   the literal find_root on |u(50)| - 1, and that map is only defined on a
   relative window ~1e-12 wide around the answer (below it the orbit decays,
   above it it overflows before t = 50, see nonlinear_ode_z0.m), so any
   find_root bracket would have to contain the answer to ~11 digits already --
   that would test the bracket, not Maxima.  rk is float-only, so wp50 is
   SKIP regardless. */
load("../harness.mac")$
load("../siam100_common.mac")$
require(["rk", "find_root"])$
skip("d13.machine", "WhenEvent")$
skip("d13.wp50", "rk (float only)")$
quit()$
